<title>UK: TVA prices 1.5 billion mark 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>TVA prices 1.5 billion mark 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tennessee Valley Authority's 1.5 billion mark 10-year bond has been priced, joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Lehman Brothers Bankhaus said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The deal was launched on Tuesday.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    18.SEP.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.173    PAY DATE    18.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER    99.173    SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT,NYSE  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS UK/DE</p>
